00:09:06,613 --> 00:09:09,215
J.: MY MOTTO IS
WALK LIKE IT'S FOR SALE

222
00:09:09,215 --> 00:09:11,384
AND THE RENT IS DUE TONIGHT.

223
00:09:13,019 --> 00:09:14,554
Tyra: I'M NOT WASTING
ANY TIME.

224
00:09:14,554 --> 00:09:17,490
I'M THROWING YOU
STRAIGHT ON A RUNWAY.

225
00:09:17,490 --> 00:09:19,392
NO TRAININ', NO NOTHIN'.

226
00:09:19,392 --> 00:09:20,794
I WANNA SEE
WHAT YOU GOT.

227
00:09:20,794 --> 00:09:22,862
