256
00:10:26,593 --> 00:10:30,763
IT'S VERY, VERY CRITICAL
THAT YOU REMEMBER YOUR ORDER.

257
00:10:30,763 --> 00:10:33,233
YOU HAVE 30 MINUTES
FROM THIS POINT ON.

258
00:10:33,233 --> 00:10:35,068
TICK-TOCK, TICK-TOCK.

259
00:10:35,068 --> 00:10:37,203
SO LET'S GO.

260
00:10:37,203 --> 00:10:39,572
ALL RIGHT, REMEMBER,
FOLLOW THE HAIR AND MAKEUP

