354
00:14:24,831 --> 00:14:27,033
♪♪♪

355
00:14:27,033 --> 00:14:29,035
Xiomara: WHOO!

356
00:14:29,035 --> 00:14:31,237
(laughing)

357
00:14:31,237 --> 00:14:32,939
♪♪♪

