360
00:14:38,911 --> 00:14:40,413
YOU SEE THIS?

361
00:14:40,413 --> 00:14:42,115
Sara: OH, MY GOD.

362
00:14:42,115 --> 00:14:44,050
THE PLACE IS JUST CRAZY.

363
00:14:44,050 --> 00:14:46,953
THE RUNWAY IN THE MIDDLE,
THE HARDWOOD FLOORS.

364
00:14:46,953 --> 00:14:48,254
I LOVE IT!

365
00:14:48,254 --> 00:14:49,255
Jenascia: GOOD JOB, JENASCIA.

366
00:14:49,255 --> 00:14:50,390
GOOD JOB.

367
00:14:50,390 --> 00:14:51,391
Yoanna: WELL, I DON'T KNOW
