388
00:15:34,467 --> 00:15:37,036
IT'S JUST THE WAY I WORK,
'CAUSE I CAN'T DEAL.

389
00:15:37,036 --> 00:15:39,872
Sara: I'M SITTING BACK,
AND I WAS JUST THINKING THAT

390
00:15:39,872 --> 00:15:41,441
I'M GONNA BE LIVING WITH
