405
00:16:09,268 --> 00:16:10,670
EVERYTHING THAT YOU'VE DONE.

406
00:16:10,670 --> 00:16:13,372
IT'S UPLIFTING TO SEE THAT
SHE'S STILL DOING HER THING.

407
00:16:13,372 --> 00:16:15,174
SHE'S STILL LOOKING FOR
A DREAM.

408
00:16:15,174 --> 00:16:17,443
YOU'RE MY MAMA. (laughing)

409
00:16:17,443 --> 00:16:18,444
Anna: COME HERE.

410
00:16:18,444 --> 00:16:19,912
Xiomara: AW.

