TALKED ABOUT IT.

414
00:16:24,717 --> 00:16:26,786
YOU KNOW, I'VE TRIED TO GET
MY SON TO UNDERSTAND.

415
00:16:26,786 --> 00:16:30,323
Anna's son: Hi, Mama!
Anna: HEY, MAKARIOUS.

416
00:16:30,323 --> 00:16:32,158
Makarious: I miss you, Mama.

417
00:16:32,158 --> 00:16:35,061
Anna: OH, THAT'S SO SWEET.

418
00:16:35,061 --> 00:16:36,295
I LOVE YOU.

419
00:16:36,295 --> 00:16:38,464
Makarious: I love you.

420
00:16:38,464 --> 00:16:39,765
Anna: (whispering)
GOOD NIGHT.

421
00:16:39,765 --> 00:16:40,733
Woman: GOOD NIGHT.

422
00:16:44,237 --> 00:16:45,638
♪♪♪

423
00:16:47,707 --> 00:16:49,408
Tyra: HI, EVERYBODY.

424
00:16:49,408 --> 00:16:51,177
Anna: GOOD MORNING!
Tyra: GOOD MORNING.

425
00:16:51,177 --> 00:16:55,114
Shandi: I SEE TYRA COMING IN
TOWARDS THE LIVING ROOM.

426
00:16:55,114 --> 00:16:56,549
I'M THINKING, "OH, NO.
WHAT'S GONNA HAPPEN?

427
00:16:56,549 --> 00:16:58,117
WHAT'S SHE GONNA SAY
TO ALL OF US?"

428
00:16:58,117 --> 00:16:59,452
Tyra: WELL, I JUST WANNA
LET YOU GUYS ALL KNOW

429
00:16:59,452 --> 00:17:01,954
THAT I HAND-SELECTED
EVERY SINGLE ONE OF YOU.

430
00:17:01,954 --> 00:17:03,189
EVERYBODY'S DIFFERENT,
AND HAS

431
00:17:03,189 --> 00:17:07,026
THEIR OWN PERSONAL STYLE,
PERSONAL FEATURES,

432
00:17:07,026 --> 00:17:10,128
AND I JUST
WANNA SAY, Y'ALL FLY.

433
00:17:10,128 --> 00:17:12,798
Women: (laughing)

434
00:17:12,798 --> 00:17:14,500
Anna: WHAT'S, LIKE,
THE MOST IMPORTANT THING,

435
00:17:14,500 --> 00:17:16,801
LIKE, WORDS OF WISDOM
