436
00:17:16,801 --> 00:17:18,804
Tyra: YOU NEED TO LIVE,
BREATHE AND EAT THIS.

437
00:17:18,804 --> 00:17:20,106
THIS NEEDS TO BE YOUR LIFE.

438
00:17:20,106 --> 00:17:22,508
I NEED YOU GUYS TO WANT THIS
SO BAD, THAT IF IT

439
00:17:22,508 --> 00:17:24,644
