THE LITTLE HEAD BOB AT THE END

891
00:34:07,345 --> 00:34:08,813
SEEMED CONTRIVED.

892
00:34:08,813 --> 00:34:10,849
Tyra: WE DON'T HAVE A PICTURE
FOR YOU, AND WHY IS THAT?

893
00:34:10,849 --> 00:34:12,484
Anna: I JUST FELT LIKE
I COULD NOT DO IT.

894
00:34:12,484 --> 00:34:14,518
IT WAS NOT LADYLIKE TO ME.

895
00:34:14,518 --> 00:34:17,455
