WHAT DOES THAT MEAN?

896
00:34:17,455 --> 00:34:19,024
Janice: HMM. I GET IT.

897
00:34:19,024 --> 00:34:20,492
IT'S YOUR RELIGION.

898
00:34:20,492 --> 00:34:22,193
Anna: IT'S NOT
SO MUCH RELIGION.

899
00:34:22,193 --> 00:34:24,295
I'M JUST, YOU KNOW,
TRYING TO BE CHRISTLIKE.

900
00:34:29,100 --> 00:34:30,402
Mercedes: I GIVE THAT A 10.

901
00:34:30,402 --> 00:34:31,902
Nigel: YOU'VE GOT
THE CONFIDENCE.

902
00:34:31,902 --> 00:34:33,103
YOU'VE GOT THE ATTITUDE.

903
00:34:33,103 --> 00:34:34,606
NOW REFINE IT.

904
00:34:34,606 --> 00:34:36,908
TONE IT DOWN A BIT.

905
00:34:36,908 --> 00:34:39,244
Janice: YOU HAVE
A GREAT POSE, A GREAT STANCE,

906
00:34:39,244 --> 00:34:41,478
AND YOUR FACE IS KNOCKOUT.

907
00:34:41,478 --> 00:34:42,614
Tyra: WELL DONE.
Nigel: WELL DONE.

908
00:34:44,114 --> 00:34:45,917
Tyra: THERE'S A LOT GOING ON,
YOU KNOW, OVER THE SHOULDER

909
00:34:45,917 --> 00:34:47,118
AND STUFF.

910
00:34:47,118 --> 00:34:48,853
Heather: I NOTICED THAT, TOO.
Tyra: YEAH.

911
00:34:48,853 --> 00:34:51,188
Nigel: WHAT DO YOU THINK?
Heather: I, I...

912
00:34:51,188 --> 00:34:52,190
I'M SPEECHLESS.

913
00:34:52,190 --> 00:34:53,291
I ABSOLUTELY LOVE IT.

914
00:34:53,291 --> 00:34:54,592
Tyra: I THINK
YOUR BODY IS GORGEOUS.

915
00:34:54,592 --> 00:34:56,594
YOU HAVE GREAT MUSCLE TONE.
AND YOU'RE ACTUALLY

916
00:34:56,594 --> 00:34:58,997
BORDERLINE PLUS SIZE,
SO YOU MAY WANT TO GAIN

917
00:34:58,997 --> 00:35:01,199
A LITTLE WEIGHT OR LOSE SOME.

918
00:35:01,199 --> 00:35:02,834
I THINK PLUS SIZE
IS ABSOLUTELY GORGEOUS.

919
00:35:04,769 --> 00:35:06,838
Janice: LOOK UP,
LOOK UP, LOOK UP.

920
00:35:06,838 --> 00:35:08,039
LOOK UP!

921
00:35:08,039 --> 00:35:09,574
NEXT TIME YOU HAVE
TO LOOK STRAIGHT OUT

922
00:35:09,574 --> 00:35:11,376
AND HOLD YOUR HEAD UP,
BUT YOU PRACTICE

923
00:35:11,376 --> 00:35:13,011
WITH A PHONE BOOK
LIKE AUDREY HEPBURN.

924
00:35:14,512 --> 00:35:16,047
Tyra: WHAT ARE YOU THINKING?
Shandi: OH, MY GOODNESS!

925
00:35:16,047 --> 00:35:17,082
Tyra: SHANDI,
DID YOU EVER THINK

926
00:35:17,082 --> 00:35:18,216
YOU COULD LOOK THAT BEAUTIFUL?

927
00:35:18,216 --> 00:35:19,684
Shandi: OH, MY GOODNESS!

928
00:35:19,684 --> 00:35:21,019
LOOK AT MY BUTT.

929
00:35:21,019 --> 00:35:22,721
I HAVE A BUTT!

930
00:35:22,721 --> 00:35:24,422
Nigel: IN THIS PICTURE
YOU ARE OUTSTANDING,

931
00:35:24,422 --> 00:35:27,993
HOWEVER, YOUR DRESS--
IT REALLY DOESN'T SAY MUCH.

932
00:35:27,993 --> 00:35:30,161
Janice: COLLEGE STUDENT,
IT SAYS,

933
00:35:30,161 --> 00:35:32,297
INSTEAD OF, LIKE,
HOPEFUL MODEL WANNABE.

934
00:35:35,967 --> 00:35:37,836
Janice: I THINK THE WALK
NEEDS A LOT OF WORK.

935
00:35:37,836 --> 00:35:39,738
IT WAS TOO STACCATO FOR ME.

936
00:35:39,738 --> 00:35:41,072
Bethany: INTERESTING!

937
00:35:41,072 --> 00:35:42,540
Janice: CHER,
EAT YOUR HEART OUT!

938
00:35:42,540 --> 00:35:44,342
Bethany: I HAD A LOT
TO WORK WITH THERE!

939
00:35:44,342 --> 00:35:46,645
Eric: I'M NOT SO SURE
ABOUT THE BOOBS.

940
00:35:46,645 --> 00:35:49,147
