IS VERY SEXY.

941
00:35:49,147 --> 00:35:51,716
YOU HAVE TO BE VERY CONSCIOUS
OF HOW YOU POSE,

942
00:35:51,716 --> 00:35:53,118
'CAUSE IT'LL TAKE YOU
AWAY FROM FASHION

943
