YOU REALLY DIDN'T

953
00:36:16,241 --> 00:36:18,243
OFFER ANYTHING SOFT.

954
00:36:18,243 --> 00:36:19,377
YOU WERE MEANT TO BE EVE.

955
00:36:19,377 --> 00:36:20,445
IT WOULD BE NICE
TO SEE JUST A LITTLE BIT

956
00:36:20,445 --> 00:36:21,880
MORE GENTLENESS IN YOU.

957
00:36:21,880 --> 00:36:24,616
YOU KNOW WHAT I'M GOING TO
TALK ABOUT THOUGH, DON'T YOU?

958
00:36:24,616 --> 00:36:28,853
YOU, YOUNG LADY,
WERE LATE FOR MY SHOOT.

959
00:36:28,853 --> 00:36:31,222
Janice: WHAT?
Nigel: YOU DIDN'T SHOW UP

960
00:36:31,222 --> 00:36:33,425
