WAS IT TWO HOURS?

961
00:36:33,425 --> 00:36:34,893
Jenascia: IT MIGHT
HAVE BEEN THREE.

962
00:36:34,893 --> 00:36:36,261
Eric: YOU'RE WASTING
OTHER PEOPLE'S MONEY.

963
00:36:36,261 --> 00:36:37,996
Jenascia: YEAH.
Janice: 5'7" IS

964
00:36:37,996 --> 00:36:41,132
A LITTLE SHORT TO BE A MODEL,
SO WE HAVE TO COMPENSATE

965
00:36:41,132 --> 00:36:42,801
WITH PUNCTUALITY.

966
00:36:42,801 --> 00:36:44,903
Tyra: TIME IS MONEY.

967
00:36:44,903 --> 00:36:46,504
Jenascia: THANK YOU.

968
00:36:48,740 --> 00:36:50,508
Tyra: ALL RIGHT,
NOW IT'S TIME TO VOTE.

969
00:36:50,508 --> 00:36:52,077
