IN FRONT OF THE CAMERA FOR SURE.

975
00:37:01,686 --> 00:37:02,754
Tyra: SARA.

976
00:37:02,754 --> 00:37:03,922
Janice: I'M NOT CRAZY
ABOUT HER.

977
00:37:03,922 --> 00:37:04,923
