COULD MOVE.

978
00:37:04,923 --> 00:37:06,558
SHE CAN SMILE.

979
00:37:06,558 --> 00:37:08,159
Tyra: CAMILLE.
Janice: CAMILLE ROCKS.

980
00:37:08,159 --> 00:37:09,828
