I PERSONALLY HAVE A PROBLEM
WITH THE BOOBS.

1011
00:37:55,273 --> 00:37:56,541
Janice: WHY?
Eric: I DON'T KNOW.

1012
00:37:56,541 --> 00:37:59,277
IT'S TOO, UH, CHA-CHA-CHA.

1013
00:37:59,277 --> 00:38:01,780
Nigel: SHE DOES LOOK
LIKE A DR. SEUSS CHARACTER.

1014
00:38:01,780 --> 00:38:03,815
