1035
00:38:42,487 --> 00:38:44,322
SHE SORT OF, LIKE,
HAD HALF AN IDEA.

1036
00:38:44,322 --> 00:38:45,924
Nigel: HOWEVER,
NORMALLY, YOU KNOW, YOU WOULD

1037
00:38:45,924 --> 00:38:48,860
