SO SHE WASN'T WARNED.

1038
00:38:48,860 --> 00:38:51,563
IN FACT, THE GIRL THAT WAS LATE
WAS MORE DAMAGING FOR ME.

1039
00:38:51,563 --> 00:38:52,630
