1068
00:40:21,419 --> 00:40:23,821
THAT YOU DIDN'T DO
THE PHOTO SHOOT,

1069
00:40:23,821 --> 00:40:25,523
BUT YOU'VE GOT
A CERTAIN RESPONSIBILITY

1070
00:40:25,523 --> 00:40:28,593
AS A WIFE AND A MOM,
AND WE RESPECT THAT.

1071
00:40:28,593 --> 00:40:30,628
JENASCIA, DO YOU KNOW
WHAT I'M GONNA TELL YOU?

1072
00:40:30,628 --> 00:40:31,796
Jenascia: THAT I WAS LATE.

1073
00:40:31,796 --> 00:40:33,731
Tyra: YOU HAVE
TO DEPEND ON YOURSELF,

1074
00:40:33,731 --> 00:40:35,633
'CAUSE THOSE GIRLS COULD HAVE
EASILY JUST SHOOK YOU AWAKE

1075
00:40:35,633 --> 00:40:37,402
AND SAID, "COME ON."

1076
00:40:37,402 --> 00:40:39,170
BUT EVERYBODY'S LOOKING OUT
FOR THEMSELVES.

1077
00:40:39,170 --> 00:40:40,605
THIS ISN'T A SORORITY.

1078
00:40:40,605 --> 00:40:43,041
THIS IS A MODELING COMPETITION.

1079
00:40:43,041 --> 00:40:46,210
WHOEVER'S NAME I DO NOT CALL
